00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.830
let's start with the common

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.990
misconception when some people hear the

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:52.400
term global warming

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:53.840
they'll point to an instance of colder

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.460
than normal weather like the Sahara

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:57.590
Desert recently and say that's

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:59.750
