00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:15.170
where does this problem come from the

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.820
largest contributing factor to climate

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:18.470
change is the burning of fossil fuels

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.019
